{
  "id": "010",
  "title": "An awareness exchange: relayed verbatim, and attributed through the session layer",
  "spec": "PROTOCOL.md#84-attributing-a-cursor-to-a-person",
  "notes": "Awareness is peer to peer and the server relays it uninspected, so the first frame is asserted as exact bytes and the second is decoded with the reference decoder: message type 1, one client (9), clock 1, and the state the peer published. The state's shape (`path` plus `selection`) is this implementation's, and each selection endpoint is a CRDT anchor, never an offset (§8.1). Both encodings appear here on purpose: the host publishes the `tname` form, which is the only representation that exists for a caret in an empty text, and the guest publishes the `item` form, naming the element the caret sits before. Because no index reaches the wire, this vector fixes no offset unit — a receiver recomputes the index against its own replica. Identity is not in the state: `awareness_client_id` on `PeerInfo` is what joins a cursor to a display name.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "open",
      "conn": "host",
      "target": "/session"
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "conn": "host",
      "text": "{\"id\":1,\"method\":\"session.hello\",\"params\":{\"awareness_client_id\":5,\"display_name\":\"Ada\",\"role\":\"host\"},\"v\":\"selvage/1\"}"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "conn": "host",
      "text": "{\"event\":\"room.created\",\"params\":{\"capabilities\":[\"y-protocols/1\",\"awareness\",\"open-document-set\",\"host-reclaim\"],\"documents\":[],\"keepalive\":{\"awareness_expire_ms\":30000,\"awareness_renew_ms\":15000,\"ping_interval_ms\":30000},\"peers\":[],\"room_id\":\"$room\",\"self\":{\"awareness_client_id\":5,\"display_name\":\"Ada\",\"peer_id\":\"$host_peer\",\"role\":\"host\"},\"token\":\"$token\"},\"v\":\"selvage/1\"}"
    },
    {
      "op": "open",
      "conn": "guest",
      "target": "/session?room=$room&token=$token"
    },
    {
      "op": "send",
      "conn": "guest",
      "text": "{\"id\":1,\"method\":\"session.hello\",\"params\":{\"awareness_client_id\":9,\"display_name\":\"Bob\",\"role\":\"guest\"},\"v\":\"selvage/1\"}"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "conn": "guest",
      "text": "{\"event\":\"room.joined\",\"params\":{\"capabilities\":[\"y-protocols/1\",\"awareness\",\"open-document-set\",\"host-reclaim\"],\"documents\":[],\"keepalive\":{\"awareness_expire_ms\":30000,\"awareness_renew_ms\":15000,\"ping_interval_ms\":30000},\"peers\":[{\"awareness_client_id\":5,\"display_name\":\"Ada\",\"peer_id\":\"$host_peer\",\"role\":\"host\"}],\"room_id\":\"$room\",\"self\":{\"awareness_client_id\":9,\"display_name\":\"Bob\",\"peer_id\":\"$guest_peer\",\"role\":\"guest\"}},\"v\":\"selvage/1\"}"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect",
      "conn": "host",
      "text": "{\"event\":\"peer.joined\",\"params\":{\"peer\":{\"awareness_client_id\":9,\"display_name\":\"Bob\",\"peer_id\":\"$guest_peer\",\"role\":\"guest\"}},\"v\":\"selvage/1\"}"
    },
    {
      "op": "sendBinary",
      "conn": "host",
      "hex": "01 7c 01 05 01 78 7b 22 70 61 74 68 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 73 65 6c 65 63 74 69 6f 6e 22 3a 7b 22 61 6e 63 68 6f 72 22 3a 7b 22 74 6e 61 6d 65 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 61 73 73 6f 63 22 3a 30 7d 2c 22 68 65 61 64 22 3a 7b 22 74 6e 61 6d 65 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 61 73 73 6f 63 22 3a 30 7d 7d 7d"
    },
    {
      "op": "expectBinary",
      "conn": "guest",
      "hex": "01 7c 01 05 01 78 7b 22 70 61 74 68 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 73 65 6c 65 63 74 69 6f 6e 22 3a 7b 22 61 6e 63 68 6f 72 22 3a 7b 22 74 6e 61 6d 65 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 61 73 73 6f 63 22 3a 30 7d 2c 22 68 65 61 64 22 3a 7b 22 74 6e 61 6d 65 22 3a 22 73 72 63 2f 6d 61 69 6e 2e 72 73 22 2c 22 61 73 73 6f 63 22 3a 30 7d 7d 7d"
    },
    {
